        "id": 1884045
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-13T17:01:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`RemoteException` means we are dead in the water. Either artd has crashed or the system is shutting down. In this case, I think there is no point to continue.",
      "parentUuid": "de27a1db_caceda99",
      "range": {
